{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eddJnbQMOT1793658275.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國上月製造業活動加速增長，生產指數創2021年以來最高。</p><p></p><p>美國供應管理學會公布，美國上月製造業指數升至55.5，為逾四年來第二高，亦好過市場預期。分項指數當中，生產指數創2021年底以來最高，反映需求的新訂單指數升至7月以來最高，並繼續處於50以上的擴張水平。</p><p></p><p>雖然數據理想，但受訪企業表示對製造商的信心近幾個月一直惡化，因通脹壓力和原材料供應受限、伊朗戰爭和關稅貿易戰，令營商情況進一步惡化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T23:21:08.711599+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T22:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:18.656698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T23:18:14.564286+00:00","content_hash":"7f2fb04dce8082dd4eb594d9b5438383e896f798d2f2556d69b28a5b487aaf97","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T23:21:08.711599+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}